<title>UK: STAGECOACH SELLS STAGECOACH MALAWI STAKE.</title>
<headline>STAGECOACH SELLS STAGECOACH MALAWI STAKE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stagecoach Holdings Plc said on Friday that it has agreed to sell its 51 percent stake in Stagecoach Malawi Ltd to Admarc Investment Holdings Company Ltd for a nominal consideration.</p>
<p>It said that Stagecoach Malawi contributed turnover of 13.2 million stg and profits of 200,000 for the year to April 30, 1997.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
